        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: Madonna of the Trail, National Old Trails Road\n- Organizations: National Society of Daughters of the American Revolution\n- Concepts: pioneer women, National Auto Trail system\n\nFacts:\n- In 1912, the National Old Trails Road, also known as the Ocean-to-Ocean Highway, was established in the United States.\n- The National Old Trails Road later became part of the National Auto Trail system in the United States.\n- Madonna of the Trail is a series of 12 monuments dedicated to the spirit of pioneer women in the United States.\n- The National Society of Daughters of the American Revolution commissioned the Madonna of the Trail monuments.",
